[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15968.79, "timestamp": "04:26:08", "text": "忘了。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15971.83, "timestamp": "04:26:11", "text": "嘿，莫西在哪儿？她真是个幸运儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15973.99, "timestamp": "04:26:13", "text": "赢家不是你。你只是其中一部分人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15976.389, "timestamp": "04:26:16", "text": "没什么大不了的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15978.71, "timestamp": "04:26:18", "text": "我的船员有代币。我会在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15982.149, "timestamp": "04:26:22", "text": "很快了，肯尼斯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15985.269, "timestamp": "04:26:25", "text": "哦，我们要去打boss了。哇。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15986.83, "timestamp": "04:26:26", "text": "去打仗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16004.55, "timestamp": "04:26:44", "text": "嗯？他们停了下来。他们完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16005.87, "timestamp": "04:26:45", "text": "他们已经完成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16009.11, "timestamp": "04:26:49", "text": "章节好的。反正，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16011.03, "timestamp": "04:26:51", "text": "我们来看看。 Excel 文件。我们不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16014.229, "timestamp": "04:26:54", "text": "需要这个。当你的扳机响起时，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16017.91, "timestamp": "04:26:57", "text": "是时候买这个了。你仍然拥有"}]